    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39303" root="نتش" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْتَاشٌ</span></b>  [<i>A kind of tweezers;</i>] <i>an instrument
with which one extracts,</i> or <i>draws</i> or <i>pulls out</i>
or <i>forth,</i> (S, A, K,) <i>a thing</i> (S,) or <i>a thorn,</i>
(A, K,) and <i>the like,</i> (K,) and <i>hair;</i> (TA;)
<i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْقَاشٌ</span>. (S, K.)

